## Verdict on the preregistered question

Work per energy under Omni against native: 38.91 -> 39.32 served requests per kJ, difference +0.407 (95% interval -0.2101 to +1.024).
Guardrails: requests served held (not below -1%), 95th-percentile response time held (not above +10%), requests not served held (not above +1% of native served).
Observation (watch against native) on the same outcome: EVEN, under the floor. Authority (omni against watch): GAIN, not beyond the noise.
**Result, by rule: EVEN (inside the noise, within the guardrails).**

